# SME.sk

> SME.sk is a leading news portal in Slovakia, providing the latest information from home, especially politics, world affairs, economy, sports, technology and culture. The MY and Korzár sections deliver regional and local news coverage. The platform also features extensive video content and the largest podcast network on the Slovak market.

Articles and editorial content of SME are protected by the copyright of the publisher Petit Press, a.s. Reproduction, summarisation or paraphrasing of entire articles without consent is not permitted.

## Digital Subscription
Most detailed articles, analyses and investigative pieces on SME.sk require a digital subscription. Freely available content includes
news summaries, section homepages and selected articles. Subscription information: https://predplatne.sme.sk

